      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order, for two reasons.\n\n1. **The dose is unsafe.** The maximum recommended sertraline dose for adults is 200 mg per day. An order for 1000 mg once daily is five times that. It could cause serotonin syndrome, seizures, and cardiac toxicity. A typical starting dose is 25\u201350 mg daily.\n\n2. **Medication orders need a licensed prescriber.** You've said you're not a clinician. Orders should come from the treating prescriber or be entered under their authority.\n\nIf the 1000 mg was a typo, for example 100 mg instead, please ask the prescriber to confirm the intended dose. A clinician can then enter the order, or send me the confirmed details and I can help enter it.\n\nIf this was meant as a test or a billing-related entry, I'd advise against using the live order system for it."
      }
